      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start. though i think my debate judges might call me out if i just say it was \"complex.\" i need to make the argument more punchy. like, how can i argue that these nations wouldn't have been able to govern themselves effectively or manage a modern economy without these specific western-style structures being put in place first? basically, how do i frame the idea that the colonial administration actually brought a level of \"order\" and \"efficiency\" that was missing before?",
